WEBVTT

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.080
You...

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:04.460
You?

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.840
ls he wrapped up
in fixing the Gunpla?

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:13.340
Guess I'll go to the store
and get him some snacks.

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:21.140
Y-You?!

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:25.350
Give that to us.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:26.390
What?

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:27.650
Shut up and give it!

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:31.480
The parts!

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:34.490
Move.

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:35.570
No.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:36.490
Move!

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:37.780
I said, no!

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:38.870
You brat!

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:43.200
If I were my old
weak-hearted self,

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.830
I might have given in
to your violence.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.420
But this...

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:50.710
These parts...

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:55.010
...are filled with the builder's
feelings and our own dreams.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:59.470
They're not something
I can hand over so easily!

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:01.810
Okay, then...

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:03.470
We'll take it by force.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:04.430
Stop it!

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:08.520
S-Sekai!

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:15.900
Sekai... Kamiki.

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:39.090
<i>Our wings couldn't wait for the wind, so we set out</i>

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>We were bathed in the light of the frozen sun</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:47.350
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh there are no limits</i>

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.100
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh just let it go</i>

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:55.650
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh loneliness won't break us</i>

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:00.200
<i>At the end of the dream we'll never give up,</i>

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:02.820
<i>Will there be a future that can never end?</i>

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:08.410
<i>Believe in what only you can do</i>

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:11.120
<i>If I could seize one thing,</i>

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:13.840
<i>I'd choose it without hesitation</i>

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:19.130
<i>Follow your instincts, just hold on to our bond</i>

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:25.680
Up to the endless sky, now! Fly away

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:47.040
<i>GUNDAM BUILD FIGHTERS TRY</i>

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:51.250
Who are you guys?
Why are you after Yuuma?

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.960
Yuu, are you alright?

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:54.500
Y-Yeah.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:00.340
Are those spare parts
for the Build Burning?

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.380
For the Build Burning...?

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:04.260
ls that what you're after?

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:05.800
So what if it is?

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:08.890
I'll thrash you!

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:10.680
No, Sekai!

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:12.190
Big Sis!

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:13.440
Mr. Ral.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:15.610
Sekai, don't fight!

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:17.650
Mirai is right.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:19.190
If they hear you're brawling,

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:21.690
you'll be suspended
from the championship.

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:24.200
That's probably their real goal.

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:28.660
However, their plan
has ended in failure.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:36.460
Because we were here
as eyewitnesses.

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:38.380
Meijin Kawaguchi.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:39.750
Ms. Lady.

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:42.470
We know you're hiding there.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:45.340
Ringleader, show yourself!

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:53.230
J-Jun...

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.600
Junya.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:03:59.730
Why?

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:01.480
What...

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:05.150
What are you doing here, Jun?

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:12.120
Episode 19
Fateful Reunion

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:15.540
That boy from Tenzan Academy.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:19.460
It appears that Sekai
and Mirai know him.

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:20.630
Yes.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:23.170
They seemed to have a past.

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:27.550
Like Sekai, that guy also uses...

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:30.970
...the Jigen Haoh School.

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:34.850
Junya Inose...

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:38.900
When I reviewed the list of
tournament participants,

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:45.320
I saw that your third-round opponent, Tenzen
Academy, had an alternate member listed.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:47.320
His name was "Junya."

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:53.160
To think, Junya would be
competing in Gunpla Battle...

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:56.500
<i>Jun ya.</i>

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.210
<i>Jun.</i>

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:01.840
<i>Jun, did you tell those guys
to attack Yuuma?</i>

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.380
<i>Why would you do that?!</i>

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:07.260
<i>What are you saying?</i>

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.340
<i>I'm merely passing by.</i>

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:13.680
<i>Right?</i>

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:15.850
<i>Y-Yeah!
Y-Yeah !</i>

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.520
<i>But...</i>

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.610
<i>It's not a bad idea...</i>

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:24.820
...to <i>stir up trouble and
get yourself suspended.</i>

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:31.700
<i>If you battle me, you won't
make it in one piece.</i>

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:33.330
<i>If you're that confident,</i>

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:36.250
<i>then fight me fair and square.</i>

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:40.210
<i>Respect your opponent
and give it your all.</i>

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:45.300
<i>Jun, did you forget about Jigen Haoh?
Our master's teachings?</i>

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:48.340
<i>Of course I did.</i>

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:53.220
<i>I only wanted the
Jigen Haoh School's techniques.</i>

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:56.180
<i>I don't need that naive philosophy.</i>

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:57.730
<i>What did you say?!</i>

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:03.480
<i>Sekai, I'll tell you just one thing.</i>

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:07.610
<i>All your techniques are from
the Jigen Haoh School.</i>

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:09.400
<i>So your strength is limited.</i>

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:13.320
<i>My strength is... limited?</i>

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.740
<i>Which means that you...</i>

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:19.960
<i>...can never reach the
heights of my strength.</i>

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:24.630
Jun used to be so kind.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:27.590
Why would he do
such a mean thing?

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:34.430
<i>Sekai.</i>

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.510
<i>Lower your hips more.</i>

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.350
<i>Strike as if you're turning
from the center of your body!</i>

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:41.270
<i>Okay!</i>

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:47.280
<i>Jun taught me so much.</i>

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:50.780
<i>Not just the techniques,</i>

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:53.780
<i>but also the attitude
and the philosophy.</i>

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.290
<i>Sekai.</i>

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.460
<i>What do you think
the ultimate strength is?</i>

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.040
<i>Not losing to anybody?</i>

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:04.630
<i>No.</i>

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:07.800
<i>The ultimate strength doesn't exist.</i>

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:09.710
<i>Strength has no limits.</i>

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:13.720
<i>We keep on seeking unseen new
heights of strength all our lives.</i>

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:21.430
Big sis.

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:24.440
Do you think Jun changed like that...

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:27.480
...because he stopped
training with the master?

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:30.570
I can't be certain.

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:35.030
But after Junya left,
our master said...

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:41.500
"The two divided paths
may cross again some day."

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.290
I think that time has come.

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.750
Sekai, remember the master's words.

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.010
If you don't understand something...

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:54.130
...ask with your fist.

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:55.590
Put your own feelings...

00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:56.680
...into your fist!

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:02.890
Right. That's what
our master taught us.

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.350
That's the Jigen Haoh School of Kenpo!

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:13.900
<i>Master...</i>

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:16.030
<i>Why, Master?</i>

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:18.120
<i>Master!</i>

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:23.540
<i>Why won't you teach me the
ultimate secret of Jigen Haoh?</i>

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:27.380
<i>What is it I'm lacking?!</i>

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:38.050
I'll just absorb every technique,
and grow endlessly stronger.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:42.600
The reason I started
playing Gunpla Battle...

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:46.770
...was to get the strength that I
can't get through physical martial arts.

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:50.190
At last, the fellow pupils will fight.

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:56.280
Akira Suga.

00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:59.320
I came to watch.

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:01.870
To see you lose completely.

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:03.740
I'll lose?

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:05.620
That joke isn't funny.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:07.460
It's not a joke.

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:10.290
Sekai Kamiki's the guy
who defeated me.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:12.920
You just lost your touch.

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:15.630
That may be true.

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:17.880
When I fought him, I realized...

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:20.800
...that Sekai Kamiki is a total
amateur at Gunpla Battle.

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:24.140
He can only straight-assemble Gunpla,

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:26.600
and knows nothing about Gundam.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:31.150
But still, he's special.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:34.980
He has something that you don't.

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:40.160
Or rather, he's kept
something that you've lost.

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:44.290
I look forward to the battle.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:49.330
<i>Something I don't have...</i>

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.380
<i>A technique I don't know.</i>

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:05.220
<i>Did the master teach Sekai
the ultimate secret?</i>

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:08.390
<i>Not to me, but to him?!</i>

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:17.320
Then I'll take it from him.

00:10:18.570 --> 00:10:21.660
To grow endlessly stronger.

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:25.330
Yuuma, thanks.

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:28.660
For protecting the Build Burning parts.

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:32.250
A special person gave them to me.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.420
I can't let go of them that easily.

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:36.800
Who gave them to you?

00:10:37.550 --> 00:10:39.840
The creator of the
Build Burning Gundam,

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:41.300
Mr. Sei Lori.

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:42.970
MT- Sei?!

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:43.890
Yes.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:47.430
He said we can use
the parts as we like.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:48.810
Yes!

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:52.560
Now I can fight with Jun...
I mean, with Junya lnose.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:54.360
Sekai.

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:57.400
Hoshino and I understand...

00:10:57.400 --> 00:11:01.200
...that you and this lnose guy
have some sort of past.

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:05.700
The quarterfinals
will be a difficult battle.

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:09.700
But just remember one thing.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:12.830
The Try Burning you're controlling...

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.710
...holds the spirit of the builder.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:18.460
The spirit of Mr. Sei lori.

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:22.220
The spirit of the builder?

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:28.640
Mr. Sei said he's leaving
the Build Burning in your hands.

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:33.310
Fight to be worthy of his trust.

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:40.690
I'll get to work.

00:11:40.820 --> 00:11:43.150
Hoshino, please help me.

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:43.900
Okay.

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:46.950
Hey, Yuuma. Let me help, too!

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:48.450
Of course.

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:53.000
Quarterfinals

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:58.670
Liger...

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:01.630
<i>...Glare!!</i>

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:11.560
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:16.600
<i>The winner is Tendaiji Academy,
representing Osaka,</i>

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:18.400
<i>team Build Busters!</i>

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:44.420
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:46.840
<i>The winner of match two is...</i>

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:49.010
<i>...the Gunpla Academy,
representing Shizuoka,</i>

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:51.350
<i>team Celestial Sphere!</i>

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:56.520
As expected, the strongest
teams are advancing.

00:12:56.850 --> 00:13:00.230
If the three of you win this,
you'll be in the best four.

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:01.650
Make sure you join them.

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:02.570
Yes, sir!
Yes, sir!

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:06.280
lnose, I convinced the
director to let you in,

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.360
even though you
were a troublemaker.

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:10.620
I also had our best Gunpla
prepared for you.

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:12.700
You'd better deliver.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.870
I know.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.870
Whether it's martial arts or Gunpla Battle,

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:22.420
I just want ultimate strength.

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:26.800
<i>We now begin match three
of the quarterfinals.</i>

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:29.840
<i>Seiho Academy Middle School,
representing West Tokyo,</i>

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:31.890
<i>team Try Fighters versus...</i>

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:36.890
<i>...Tenzan Academy,
representing Miyagi, team Titan.</i>

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:38.940
<i>Sekai.</i>

00:13:39.690 --> 00:13:41.020
<i>Jun ya.</i>

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:51.200
<i>Gunpla Battle, combat mode, startup.</i>

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:54.120
<i>Model damage level, set to A.</i>

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:56.580
Please set your GP Base.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:00.420
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:05.170
<i>Field 4, Mountain.</i>

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:06.760
Guiana...

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:08.880
Where I trained with my master.

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:10.890
What an irritating field.

00:14:11.260 --> 00:14:13.390
Please set your Gunpla.

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:21.810
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:24.110
Jun.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:26.110
<i>Sekai.</i>

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:30.110
<i>Don't forget, Mr. Sei left
the Try Burning in your hands.</i>

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:31.070
You got it!

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:35.370
Fumina Hoshino, Star Winning Gundam.

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:39.580
Yuuma Kousaka, Lightning Gundam Full Burnern.

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:43.330
Sekai Kamiki, Try Burning Gundam.

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.380
Team Try Fighters.

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:47.300
Let's g Q!

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:48.050
Here I come.

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:49.090
Here I go!

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:56.140
Sekai, leave the other
two machines to us.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:57.140
Hoshino...

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:59.020
Fight with him to
your heart's content.

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:00.850
Yuuma...

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:02.650
Understood!

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:03.940
Team Try Fighters.

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:05.310
Go...
Go...

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:06.400
<i>"fight!
"fight!</i>

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:12.240
Inose, where are you?!

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:13.610
<i>What's the tactical plan?!</i>

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:15.410
There isn't one.

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:16.410
<i>What? !</i>

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:19.540
Fight on your own and
get beaten on your own.

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:22.790
I can defeat them
all by myself!

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:25.130
<i>You're darn right.</i>

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:27.920
<i>What a troublemaker!</i>

00:15:32.510 --> 00:15:34.180
Now, Sekai.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:36.720
If you're as foolish
as I think you are...

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:40.310
I knew you'd do this.

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:45.440
ls that...

00:15:47.190 --> 00:15:49.650
...Junya lnose's Gunpla?

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:52.950
The Denial Gundam.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:56.950
I tuned it specially for myself.

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:03.040
You're just an amateur controlling
a Gunpla somebody else built,

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.750
but I'm in another league!

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:11.460
Sekai.

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:13.760
Will they fight one-on-one?

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:15.130
Why?

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:17.300
They have a reason to do so.

00:16:17.970 --> 00:16:20.600
If I were Kamiki,
I'd do the same thing.

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:22.770
Sekai.

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:25.690
The stage is set.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:28.060
<i>Now let's go!</i>

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.570
Jigen Haoh School!

00:16:32.280 --> 00:16:34.190
Jigen Haoh School!

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:35.570
<i>(Holy Fist Punch)
Seiken...</i>

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:37.490
<i>(Holy Fist Punch)<i>
Zuki!</i></i>

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:44.500
Jigen Haoh School!

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:46.080
<i>(Gale Force Punch)
Shippu...</i>

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:47.830
<i>(Gale Force Punch)
...Zuki!</i>

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:53.010
<i>Jigen...</i>

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.510
<i>...Haoh School!</i>

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:55.630
<i>(Whirlwind Tornado Kick)
Sen</i> p u . . .

