00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:49.930
<i>There's a tomorrow I want to touch</i>

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:53.310
<i>I want to prove it for myself</i>

00:21:53.310 --> 00:21:58.100
<i>Love, hate, which is it?</i>

00:21:58.890 --> 00:22:01.940
<i>Perhaps the challenge is in the journey</i>

00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:05.070
<i>Wandering the unknown path...</i>

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:11.780
